{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIT is not a long or complicated game. It's a sandbox where you can smash up clay heads, use loads of weapons,  and beat up a car.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Play the game that has over 1,800 5-star reviews on the Quest store!\u2b50</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fun game to get your anger out no bugs just fun...&quot; - Meta Quest store review</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;W game -\u00a0This games amazing! Also I love how they say different voice lines&quot; - Meta Quest store review</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Great game -\u00a0I had a lot of fun playing this game but I hit my hand on the wall&quot; - Meta Quest store review</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc4a <strong>The Ultimate Stress-Buster!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take out your stress by pummelling, slapping, and whacking squishy clay heads. Thanks to the wild soft body physics, every hit deforms and reshapes the heads in hilariously unpredictable ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/a229e31688385268bcfb22f983b3503a.poster.avif?t=1753427663\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/a229e31688385268bcfb22f983b3503a.webm?t=1753427663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/a229e31688385268bcfb22f983b3503a.mp4?t=1753427663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude93<strong>Choose Your Weapon</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try them all:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistol</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anvil</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baseball Bat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sledgehammer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrench</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crowbar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail Gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Justice Stick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Syringe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knife</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nunchaku</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headbutt (not recommended if standing near a wall)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/8496d1433f9a1893934059b892d9dc94.poster.avif?t=1753427663\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/8496d1433f9a1893934059b892d9dc94.webm?t=1753427663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/8496d1433f9a1893934059b892d9dc94.mp4?t=1753427663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc64<strong>44+</strong>\u00a0<strong>Unique Heads to Wreck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one reacts to your hits with funny voices and expressions (including 10 Content Creators you might recognise!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/d1931e10c0a44431eb28df21c2f514e3.poster.avif?t=1753427663\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/d1931e10c0a44431eb28df21c2f514e3.webm?t=1753427663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/d1931e10c0a44431eb28df21c2f514e3.mp4?t=1753427663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude97 Take a break from hitting heads, smash a car instead!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hands, weapons, or anything you can find to beat the car up into tiny pieces. Take your time to smash it, or try to beat the clock in a timed challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/adbf78c7ed0c6d8b139df7a63dbcbe79.poster.avif?t=1753427663\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/adbf78c7ed0c6d8b139df7a63dbcbe79.webm?t=1753427663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/adbf78c7ed0c6d8b139df7a63dbcbe79.mp4?t=1753427663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f<strong>Chill Vibes or Dark Places</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy in peace, surrounded by a tranquil paradise OR pull the lever to enter scary Dystopia world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/1932d240df04f4bbebea361341dfb171.poster.avif?t=1753427663\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/1932d240df04f4bbebea361341dfb171.webm?t=1753427663\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/extras/1932d240df04f4bbebea361341dfb171.mp4?t=1753427663\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555410?t=1753427663","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/3866583c3727373185a81428979cbcbd6833b40c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753427663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/8cd42fc20132b10ffa7c95201870ed941c2d06f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753427663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555410/8cd42fc20132b10ffa7c95201870ed941c2d06f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753427663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIT is not a long or complicated game. It's a sandbox where you can smash up clay heads, use loads of weapons,  and beat up a car.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Play the game that has over 1,800 5-star reviews on the Quest store!\u2b50</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fun game to get your anger out no bugs just fun...&quot; - Meta Quest store review</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;W game -\u00a0This games amazing! Also I love how they say different voice lines&quot; - Meta Quest store review</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Great game -\u00a0I had a lot of fun playing this game but I hit my hand on the wall&quot; - Meta Quest store review</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc4a <strong>The Ultimate Stress-Buster!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take out your stress by pummelling, slapping, and whacking squishy clay heads. Thanks to the wild soft body physics, every hit deforms and res